  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759973,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 18 Wheeler: American Pro Trucker - GameCube\n\nGet ready to experience the open road in *18 Wheeler: American Pro Trucker*, a high-octane arcade racing game where you take the wheel of a massive 18-wheeler! Transport cargo across the United States, from New York to California, competing against rival truckers and the clock in a thrilling race to the finish. \n\nChoose from a roster of unique drivers, each with their own customized truck boasting distinct speed, torque, and toughness stats. Master arcade-style racing, test your precision in challenging parking scenarios reminiscent of *Crazy Taxi*, and compete head-to-head in versus mode. Earn upgrades for your truck by skillfully navigating parking challenges, unlocking powerful enhancements. \n\nBeyond the main race, strategically ram special vans for time bonuses, utilize slipstreaming to gain speed, and sound your horn to clear the road.  Face off against the persistent \"Lizard Tail\" rival and manage your cargo carefully – damage costs money! With four distinct gameplay modes and split-screen multiplayer, *18 Wheeler* delivers a uniquely engaging trucking experience."
    },
